<title>JAPAN: Denso to buy back 8 mln shares or 20 bln yen worth.</title>
<headline>Denso to buy back 8 mln shares or 20 bln yen worth.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denso Corp said on Wednesday it had decided to buy back up to eight million of its shares or up to 20 billion yen worth.</p>
</text>
